              "note": "microscopic on/off switches"
            },
            {
              "term": "Bit",
              "note": "the smallest piece of information"
            },
            {
              "term": "Byte",
              "note": "a package of eight bits"
            },
            {
              "term": "Character Encoding",
              "note": "ASCII 或 UTF-8，把字符映射到二进制值"
            }
          ],
